  "details": "Two days ago, while I'm playing VRChat, a gravity direction of PhysBones suddenly directed to the left.\n\nAfter a few minutes, it was fixed automatically.\n\nAt the same time, my friend in the same instance also experienced the same issue.\n\nWorld: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_c7812325-4cbc-4a45-8ea9-bcc132cb5455\n\nInstance: wrld_3dbdd288-1aba-4202-bf6b-211b47429f59:99923~hidden(usr_9376f203-bb5d-4bbd-ad08-e0255568e4c6)~region(jp)\n\nTime: around 2024-09-01 04/05/26 JST\n\nI'm preserving the log file (output_log_2024-09-01_00-32-52.txt) for this launch but I don't want to share it publicly so I want some private way to share it with VRChat team if needed.",
